---
title: "图 04：Workspace 开通端到端业务时序"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as 客户
    participant Console
    participant CP as Control Plane
    participant CPDB as Control Plane DB
    participant Gateway as Sub2API
    participant Fabric
    participant Provider
    participant Ledger

    Customer->>Console: 选择 Package 并确认价格
    Console->>CP: LaunchWorkspace(name, packageId, autoRenew, intentId)
    CP->>CP: 校验 Session、CSRF、Account、Package 与 Policy
    CP->>CPDB: 读取对账 Guard 和进行中的 Operation
    CP->>Fabric: Catalog + Provider Preflight
    Fabric->>Provider: 只读容量、规格、价格和可用性检查
    Provider-->>Fabric: 权威 Preflight Facts
    Fabric-->>CP: 可履约套餐与资源快照
    CP->>Gateway: 读取身份、余额和账户状态
    Gateway-->>CP: 权威 Wallet Facts
    CP->>CPDB: Claim WorkspaceOperation
    CP-->>Console: 202 Accepted + Operation ID
    CP->>Gateway: 创建或收敛 Workspace Key
    Gateway-->>CP: Key ID
    CP->>Gateway: 幂等扣除一个月总价
    Gateway-->>CP: Debit Readback

    loop Compute、Storage、Attachment、Secret、Runtime
        CP->>Fabric: ReadStage
        Fabric->>Provider: 权威资源回读
        Provider-->>Fabric: absent / pending / ready / unknown
        Fabric-->>CP: Typed Observation
        CP->>CPDB: CAS 预留 Stage Attempt
        CP->>Fabric: EnsureStage + Idempotency Key
        Fabric->>Provider: 有界资源 Mutation
        Provider-->>Fabric: Mutation Result
        Fabric-->>CP: Mutation 后权威回读
        CP->>CPDB: CAS 推进 Stage Cursor
    end

    CP->>CPDB: 原子激活 Workspace Entitlement
    CP->>Ledger: Record Purchase Receipt
    Ledger-->>CP: Receipt ID
    CP->>CPDB: Operation = succeeded
    Console->>CP: 查询原 Operation
    Console->>CP: 重新读取 Workspace
    CP-->>Console: Workspace Ready + Access Projection
    Console-->>Customer: 打开在线 OPL Workspace
